The test inputs in tests/data/ (simple_mozart_k265_var1, mozart_k265_var1,
Bach-fugue_bwv_858: MusicXML, MIDI and .match files) are copied unchanged from
pymatchmaker v0.4.0 (matchmaker/assets), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. The golden data in tests/golden/ is generated from that release.

The learned pitch-template archive in src/prob/assets/pitch_templates_16000_640.npz is
redistributed from pymatchmaker v0.4.0 under the upstream repository's Apache License 2.0.
Its source commit and SHA-256 are recorded in specs/004-audio-methods/research.md; the
upstream release does not identify the archive's training corpus.

The Online Transformer Matcher is ported from Parangonar 3.4.1
(https://github.com/sildater/parangonar), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. Its alignment_transformer_checkpoint.pt is converted to the compact
inference-only assets/otm/model.bin; unused positional rows and optimizer metadata
are omitted. The source, hashes, and tensor layout are recorded in assets/otm/model.json.
The upstream package does not document the model's training-data provenance.
